        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> metaph.,
			of shoes that are too large, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἔνεον ἐν ταῖς
				ἐμβάσιν</span>
			<i>was floating</i> in my shoes, as if they were boats, <i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>Eq.</u>
				321
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">νεῖν ἐξ ὑπτίας,</span>
			
				v.
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὕπτιος</span>
			
			<i><span class="en">
				11
			</span></i>. fin. (Prob. cogn. with <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">νάω,</span> Lat. <i>nare.</i>)</div>
